kite_fem  —  https://github.com/awegroup/kite_fem
================================================================================

The measured-kite validation data under validation/data/hanging_validation/ is
vendored from kite_fem (MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Patrick Roeleveld), `main` at
commit 630c8c0, recorded in that directory's .source_commit. The files are
byte-for-byte copies except for two renames documented in its README.md.

The empirical inflatable-tube moment-curvature fits used by
src/billow/elements/inflatable.py originate in ASKITE and are applied by
kite_fem; Billow integrates them into a strain energy rather than applying them
as secant stiffnesses (see AGENTS.md, "The inflatable tube").

kite_fem is also an OPTIONAL comparison dependency of the validation suite
(the [compare] extra). It is not required to install or use this package.

